# Manual public proxy/VPN/abuse endpoint blocklist.
#
# Add one IP address or CIDR network per line. Blank lines and comments are
# ignored. The packaged refresh helper loads these entries into:
#
#   blocked_ipv4
#   blocked_ipv6
#
# Additional local files can be placed in /etc/geoipsets.blocklist.d/*.list.
# Dynamic fetched feeds are stored under /var/lib/geoipsets/blocklists/feeds/.
#
# Examples:
# 45.146.55.104
# 203.0.113.0/24
# 2001:db8:bad::/48
